{title: 2. Gloria A dios}
{subtitle: Canto de Gloria}
{key: Em}

{comment: Verso 1}
{start_of_verse}
/[Em]Gloria a Dios, gloria a Dios, [D]Gloria [B7]al [Em]Padre.../
{end_of_verse}

{comment: Coro}
{start_of_chorus}
/[G]A     [D]Él le [B7]sea la [Em]gloria/
/A[B7]leluya [Em]amén, a[B7]leluya [Em]amén/
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Verso 2}
{start_of_verse}
/[Em]Gloria a Dios, gloria a Dios, [D]Gloria [B7]al [Em]Hijo.../
{end_of_verse}

{comment: Verso 3}
{start_of_verse}
/[Em]Gloria a Dios, gloria a Dios, [D]Espíri[B7]tu [Em]Santo.../
{end_of_verse}

